    "biography": "<p>A Philippine hog shapeshifter (aswang); in human form it has extremely thick, hard fingernails.</p><p><strong>Powers:</strong> Enhanced Physical Characteristics (in animal form), Regeneration</p><p><strong>Weaknesses:</strong> Allergy (Silver, Severe), Vulnerability (Silver)</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> This sheet is the HUMAN form. In hog form use the hog's attributes (A, from the core critter tables): Body A + 2, Quickness (A + 1) with running multiplier (A + 1), Strength A + 2, Charisma 5, Intelligence 3, Willpower 3, Essence (8), Reaction 5, attack (A + 1)(A) as printed, from the animal's Attack code. Pugot also add +1 Body, +1 Strength and +2D6 Initiative in animal form. A = the core book's Dog, Large (B 3 · Q 4 × 4 · S 3 · 6M, core p.233) as a stand-in, since no book prints hog statistics; the hog form is under Forms on the sheet. Only its natural attack works in animal form.</p><p><em>Printed stats: B 5 · Q 4 × 5 · S 5 · C 5 · I 3 · W 3 · E (8) · R 5; Attacks Humanoid (human form); (A + 1)(A) (animal form). Running multiplier ×5; dual-natured. Cyberpirates p.149.</em></p><p><em>On the sheet: the sheet's running rate uses ×3 — use ×5 by hand; animal-form running multiplier ×5 by hand; Threat Rating 4 is this module's estimate (the average attribute), not the book's.</em></p>",
